sequenceDiagram
    actor S as RestaurantStaff
    participant O as Order
    participant U as User

    Note over O: Order is in CONFIRMED status

    activate S
    S->>O: updateStatus(PREPARED)
    activate O
    O->>O: status = PREPARED
    O->>U: notify("Your order is prepared")
    activate U
    U-->>O: None
    deactivate U
    O-->>S: None
    deactivate O

    S->>O: updateStatus(DELIVERED)
    activate O
    O->>O: status = DELIVERED
    O->>U: notify("Your order has been delivered")
    activate U
    U-->>O: None
    deactivate U
    O-->>S: None
    deactivate O
    deactivate S